cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenNDM in published work, please cite it."
title: "OpenNDM: Open Nodal Diffusion Method"
abstract: >-
  A three-dimensional, multi-group nodal diffusion solver for reactor core
  analysis, with a C++17 core and a group-constant generation path built
  natively on the OpenMC stack. It provides the core-calculation stage of a
  two-step lattice-to-core scheme in which OpenMC performs the lattice physics.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rizkiokt/openndm"
url: "https://openndm.readthedocs.io"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
keywords:
  - nuclear engineering
  - reactor physics
  - neutron diffusion
  - nodal methods
  - neutronics
  - OpenMC
